      "OriginalText": "Meteor shower flowing",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 1,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 2.8,
      "EndSecond": 4.1,
      "OriginalText": "A beautiful night",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 2,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 4.2,
      "EndSecond": 8.1,
      "OriginalText": "When I came to, you were gone",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 3,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 10.7,
      "EndSecond": 15.9,
      "OriginalText": "Where is my heart? Is it somewhere in my chest?",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 4,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 16,
      "EndSecond": 21.2,
      "OriginalText": "I tried to touch it, but I don't quite understand",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 5,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 21.3,
      "EndSecond": 27.1,
      "OriginalText": "Right around my feet, that is where fear is",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 6,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 27.2,
      "EndSecond": 31.7,
      "OriginalText": "Causing me to lose courage, let alone even move",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 7,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 31.8,
      "EndSecond": 38.9,
      "OriginalText": "But if I start crying, someone will reach their hand out",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 8,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 39,
      "EndSecond": 45.3,
      "OriginalText": "Yes, I'll do just that, despite being what they call an adult",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 9,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 45.5,
      "EndSecond": 53.7,
      "OriginalText": "Right now, the stars shoot past us and graze your pale cheek",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 10,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 53.8,
      "EndSecond": 59.8,
      "OriginalText": "Right now, the sakura petals flutter around and conceal you",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 11,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 59.9,
      "EndSecond": 67.9,
      "OriginalText": "This morning, I had a nightmare that broke my heart, and now I'm so captivated by your eyelashes",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 12,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 68,
      "EndSecond": 73.2,
      "OriginalText": "That I've lost sight of what is truly important",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 13,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 73.3,
      "EndSecond": 78.2,
      "OriginalText": "So, whether we're up against the raging seas or vast galaxy",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 14,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 78.3,
      "EndSecond": 84.3,
      "OriginalText": "Let's go",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    }
  ]
}